>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `CS_CLARSIMP_TAC`

``` hol4
clasimpLib.CS_CLARSIMP_TAC :
  clasetLib.claset -> simpLib.simpset -> tactic
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Constructs the context-explicit form of `CLARSIMP_TAC`.

`CS_CLARSIMP_TAC cs ss` performs safe assumption-aware full simplification
with `ss`, then clarifies with safe simplification installed as a wrapper
on `cs`. A premise splitter in `ss` can create multiple subgoals even
though clarification itself avoids genuine branching.

The tactic reads no global clasimp state and processes no theorem list. It
can leave residual goals, but succeeds only when the goal state changes.

### Failure

Fails if simplification and clarification leave the goal unchanged.

### Example

``` hol4
val clarsimp =
  clasimpLib.CS_CLARSIMP_TAC
    (clasetLib.the_claset ()) (clasimpLib.clasimp_ss ());
```

